There was another tremor inside the cave? Is everyone all right?

A mysterious voice? Yes, we heard it. It said:
"No! Go back! Do not taint the sacred realm with your insignificance!"
I heard those words come from Diana's mouth when she went into a trance. I believe the mysterious voice was heard across the whole continent.

After crossing the passage, you came upon a red sky? The air is scorching and stifling... There was lava everywhere? It must be a terrible place.
We need more information.

Please, tend to your wounds and come back later.
